const months=["มกราคม","กุมภาพันธ์","มีนาคม","เมษายน","พฤษภาคม","มิถุนายน","กรกฎาคม","สิงหาคม","กันยายน","ตุลาคม","พฤศจิกายน","ธันวาคม"],days=["อาทิตย์","จันทร์","อังคาร","พุธ","พฤหัสบดี","ศุกร์","เสาร์"];let data=[];
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);const tip=d3.select('body').append('div').attr('class','d3-tooltip').style('opacity',0);
function clean(v){return String(v??'').trim()}function dateObj(v){let p=clean(v).split(/[\/-]/).map(Number);return p.length===3?(p[0]>31?new Date(p[0],p[1]-1,p[2]):new Date(p[2],p[1]-1,p[0])):null}
function enrich(r){let d=dateObj(r.DeadDate_EN);return {...r,d,m:d?.getMonth(),w:d?.getDay(),age:(r.Age!==''&&Number(r.Age)>=0)?Number(r.Age):null,province:clean(r.Province)||'ไม่ระบุจังหวัด',vehicle:clean(r.Vehicle)||'ไม่ระบุพาหนะ',sex:clean(r.Sex)||'ไม่ระบุเพศ'}}
function csv(t){const rows=[];let a=[],c='',q=false;for(let i=0;i<t.length;i++){let x=t[i],n=t[i+1];if(x==='"'&&q&&n==='"'){c+='"';i++;continue}if(x==='"'){q=!q;continue}if(x===','&&!q){a.push(c);c='';continue}if((x==='\n'||x==='\r')&&!q){if(x==='\r'&&n==='\n')i++;a.push(c);if(a.some(v=>v!==''))rows.push(a);a=[];c='';continue}c+=x}if(c||a.length){a.push(c);rows.push(a)}let h=rows.shift().map(x=>x.replace(/^\uFEFF/,''));return rows.map(r=>Object.fromEntries(h.map((x,i)=>[x,r[i]??''])))}
function uniq(a){return [...new Set(a.filter(Boolean))].sort((a,b)=>String(a).localeCompare(String(b),'th'))}function fill(id,vals){$(id).innerHTML='<option value="">ทั้งหมด</option>'+vals.map(v=>`<option value="${String(v).replaceAll('"','&quot;')}">${v}</option>`).join('')}
function filt(){return data.filter(r=>(!$('month').value||r.m==$('month').value)&&(!$('sex').value||r.sex===$('sex').value)&&(!$('province').value||r.province===$('province').value)&&(!$('vehicle').value||r.vehicle===$('vehicle').value)&&(!$('weekday').value||r.w==$('weekday').value))}
function counts(a,k){let m=new Map();a.forEach(r=>m.set(r[k],(m.get(r[k])||0)+1));return [...m.entries()].sort((x,y)=>y[1]-x[1])}
function showTip(event,title,lines){tip.html(`<strong>${title}</strong>${lines.map(x=>`<div>${x}</div>`).join('')}`).style('opacity',1).style('left',(event.pageX+14)+'px').style('top',(event.pageY+14)+'px')}
function hideTip(){tip.style('opacity',0)}
const colors={monthly:'#2563eb',sex:'#f97316',vehicle:'#0f766e',province:'#7c3aed',weekday:'#dc2626'};
function svgBar(sel,vals,horiz=false,color='#2563eb'){d3.select(sel).selectAll('*').remove();let box=document.querySelector(sel).getBoundingClientRect(),W=Math.max(320,box.width),H=horiz?Math.max(360,vals.length*30+60):320,m=horiz?{t:15,r:30,b:45,l:155}:{t:20,r:25,b:65,l:50},svg=d3.select(sel).append('svg').attr('viewBox',`0 0 ${W} ${H}`).attr('width','100%').attr('height',H);let x=horiz?d3.scaleLinear().domain([0,d3.max(vals,d=>d[1])||1]).nice().range([m.l,W-m.r]):d3.scaleBand().domain(vals.map(d=>d[0])).range([m.l,W-m.r]).padding(.25),y=horiz?d3.scaleBand().domain(vals.map(d=>d[0])).range([m.t,H-m.b]).padding(.2):d3.scaleLinear().domain([0,d3.max(vals,d=>d[1])||1]).nice().range([H-m.b,m.t]);if(horiz){svg.append('g').attr('class','axis').attr('transform',`translate(0,${H-m.b})`).call(d3.axisBottom(x).ticks(5));svg.append('g').attr('class','axis').attr('transform',`translate(${m.l},0)`).call(d3.axisLeft(y));svg.selectAll('.bar').data(vals).join('rect').attr('class','bar').attr('x',m.l).attr('y',d=>y(d[0])).attr('width',d=>x(d[1])-m.l).attr('height',y.bandwidth()).attr('fill',color).on('mousemove',function(event,d){d3.select(this).attr('opacity',1).attr('transform',`translate(-2,-2) scale(1.01)`);showTip(event,d[0],[`จำนวน: ${d[1].toLocaleString()} รายการ`])}).on('mouseleave',function(){d3.select(this).attr('opacity',.9).attr('transform',null);hideTip()})}else{svg.append('g').attr('class','axis').attr('transform',`translate(0,${H-m.b})`).call(d3.axisBottom(x));svg.append('g').attr('class','axis').attr('transform',`translate(${m.l},0)`).call(d3.axisLeft(y).ticks(5));svg.selectAll('.bar').data(vals).join('rect').attr('class','bar').attr('x',d=>x(d[0])).attr('y',d=>y(d[1])).attr('width',x.bandwidth()).attr('height',d=>H-m.b-y(d[1])).attr('fill',color).on('mousemove',function(event,d){d3.select(this).attr('opacity',1).attr('transform','translate(0,-3)');showTip(event,d[0],[`จำนวน: ${d[1].toLocaleString()} รายการ`])}).on('mouseleave',function(){d3.select(this).attr('opacity',.9).attr('transform',null);hideTip()})}}
function lineChart(sel,vals){d3.select(sel).selectAll('*').remove();let box=document.querySelector(sel).getBoundingClientRect(),W=Math.max(320,box.width),H=320,m={t:20,r:25,b:50,l:50},svg=d3.select(sel).append('svg').attr('viewBox',`0 0 ${W} ${H}`).attr('width','100%').attr('height',H),x=d3.scalePoint().domain(vals.map(d=>months[d[0]])).range([m.l,W-m.r]),y=d3.scaleLinear().domain([0,d3.max(vals,d=>d[1])||1]).nice().range([H-m.b,m.t]);svg.append('g').attr('class','axis').attr('transform',`translate(0,${H-m.b})`).call(d3.axisBottom(x));svg.append('g').attr('class','axis').attr('transform',`translate(${m.l},0)`).call(d3.axisLeft(y).ticks(5));svg.append('path').datum(vals).attr('class','line').attr('d',d3.line().x(d=>x(months[d[0]])).y(d=>y(d[1])));svg.selectAll('.dot').data(vals).join('circle').attr('class','dot').attr('cx',d=>x(months[d[0]])).attr('cy',d=>y(d[1])).attr('r',6).on('mousemove',function(event,d){d3.select(this).transition().duration(100).attr('r',11);showTip(event,months[d[0]],[`จำนวน: ${d[1].toLocaleString()} รายการ`])}).on('mouseleave',function(){d3.select(this).transition().duration(100).attr('r',6);hideTip()})}
function donut(sel,vals){d3.select(sel).selectAll('*').remove();let box=document.querySelector(sel).getBoundingClientRect(),W=Math.max(300,box.width),H=320,R=Math.min(W,H)/2-25,cx=W/2,cy=H/2,color=d3.scaleOrdinal().domain(vals.map(d=>d[0])).range(['#f97316','#2563eb','#16a34a','#a855f7','#64748b']);let svg=d3.select(sel).append('svg').attr('viewBox',`0 0 ${W} ${H}`).attr('width','100%').attr('height',H),g=svg.append('g').attr('transform',`translate(${cx},${cy})`),pie=d3.pie().value(d=>d[1]),arc=d3.arc().innerRadius(R*.52).outerRadius(R);g.selectAll('path').data(pie(vals)).join('path').attr('d',arc).attr('fill',d=>color(d.data[0])).attr('stroke','#fff').attr('stroke-width',3).on('mousemove',function(event,d){d3.select(this).transition().duration(100).attr('transform',`translate(${Math.cos((d.startAngle+d.endAngle)/2)*10},${Math.sin((d.startAngle+d.endAngle)/2)*10})`);showTip(event,d.data[0],[`จำนวน: ${d.data[1].toLocaleString()} รายการ`])}).on('mouseleave',function(){d3.select(this).transition().duration(100).attr('transform',null);hideTip()});svg.append('text').attr('x',cx).attr('y',cy-5).attr('text-anchor','middle').attr('class','donut-total').text(vals.reduce((a,b)=>a+b[1],0).toLocaleString());svg.append('text').attr('x',cx).attr('y',cy+18).attr('text-anchor','middle').attr('class','donut-label').text('รายการ')}
function render(){let a=filt(),ages=a.map(r=>r.age).filter(Number.isFinite),avg=ages.length?ages.reduce((x,y)=>x+y,0)/ages.length:0;$('total').textContent=a.length.toLocaleString();$('age').textContent=ages.length?avg.toFixed(1)+' ปี':'-';$('ageBig').textContent=ages.length?avg.toFixed(1)+' ปี':'-';$('male').textContent=a.filter(r=>r.sex==='ชาย').length.toLocaleString();$('provCount').textContent=new Set(a.map(r=>r.province)).size;$('topVehicle').textContent=counts(a,'vehicle')[0]?.[0]||'-';$('status').textContent=`แสดง ${a.length.toLocaleString()} จาก ${data.length.toLocaleString()} รายการ`;lineChart('#monthly',counts(a,'m').sort((x,y)=>x[0]-y[0]));donut('#sexChart',counts(a,'sex'));svgBar('#vehicleChart',counts(a,'vehicle'),true,colors.vehicle);svgBar('#provinceChart',counts(a,'province').slice(0,15),true,colors.province);svgBar('#weekdayChart',counts(a,'w').sort((x,y)=>x[0]-y[0]).map(x=>[days[x[0]],x[1]]),false,colors.weekday)}
fetch('_2026_cleaned.csv').then(r=>r.text()).then(t=>{data=csv(t).map(enrich);const pm=[...new Set(data.map(r=>r.m).filter(Number.isInteger))].sort((a,b)=>a-b);$('month').innerHTML='<option value="">ทั้งหมด</option>'+pm.map(m=>`<option value="${m}">${months[m]}</option>`).join('');fill('sex',uniq(data.map(r=>r.sex)));fill('province',uniq(data.map(r=>r.province)));fill('vehicle',uniq(data.map(r=>r.vehicle)));const pd=[...new Set(data.map(r=>r.w).filter(Number.isInteger))].sort((a,b)=>a-b);$('weekday').innerHTML='<option value="">ทั้งหมด</option>'+pd.map(i=>`<option value="${i}">${days[i]}</option>`).join('');render()}).catch(e=>$('status').textContent='โหลดข้อมูลไม่สำเร็จ: '+e.message);['month','sex','province','vehicle','weekday'].forEach(id=>$(id).onchange=render);$('reset').onclick=()=>{['month','sex','province','vehicle','weekday'].forEach(id=>$(id).value='');render()};
